 "id": "1135973622087629", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310726_1135973625420962_2277008678819858899_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZWTdFpHZcPoQ7kNvwGvSor6&_nc_oc=AdqVlifn-AG3Yg9X7qm-0oas5P33_lTQTH_adxi9qTRRAn1OrXNP-jxm0c0wRBBv8UE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNjH2xQuaY2TYPHY-f1FlQVax_87LJTTc_I6DiHFtK3Nw&oe=6AE0C755"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1622280675900964", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_1622280679234297_8199383102170128567_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=96NfsYaEOWwQ7kNvwFVS6wp&_nc_oc=Adq_d4VDK26EzIbt7JrbDO_h0BeKyFgP255xQhLVaqJ8Ebch3U6v9BbcR_A-hY5xSr0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMZmUgk7D0L7oSKrshJP9bLqqPT6JFcBf9IYe_jngd-KA&oe=6AE0CD7C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1599982151724814", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_1599982158391480_7728604499574247742_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cDr1fDUKqjEQ7kNvwH8qPbT&_nc_oc=AdpS6GuGVnYb6IHCJi5SGze9RzhR8qenU-jmnZn_MvKeye5pZQZrCxtLjv-vTtMSyZQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNcX5VNLrXUaftVuae7a9UAdXqhqWi0KV6rfv9VAXUOtw&oe=6AE0A5B5"}, "display_name": "Echo Room VR: Escape the Dark", "keywords": ["Maze", "Dark", "Survival", "Stealth", "Echolocation"], "long_description": "**To see the way out, you must break the silence.**\n\n*Echo Room VR* is a gripping first-person puzzle-exploration game that plunges you into absolute darkness. Trapped blind inside a derelict research facility, your only lifelines are a mysterious alter ego guiding you and your ability to create sound.\n\nUsing your VR controller or headset microphone, emit echolocation \"pings\" to briefly illuminate the world. Sound waves paint the environment in fleeting topological lines\u2014revealing walls, hidden corridors, and complex puzzles before fading to black.\n\n**The Price of Vision** Echolocation is your greatest tool and biggest liability. Sound-hunting entities stalk the shadows, drawn to the pings you need to navigate. Every noise trades visibility for danger. Will you risk a loud ping to map a maze, or use quiet taps to slip past horrors unseen?\n\n**Unravel the Mystery** Outsmart the facility's security and piece together the tragic lore of the accident that condemned this place. \n\n**Key Features:**\n*   **Innovative Echolocation:** Use your controller or real-world voice to \"ping\" and reveal your environment.\n*   **High-Stakes Puzzles:** Solve intricate environmental puzzles and navigate timed mazes completely in the dark.\n*   **Tense Stealth:** Evade terrifying, sound-sensitive entities. \n*   **HUD-Free Immersion:** With no mini-map or on-screen UI to guide you, rely entirely on your spatial awareness and memory.\n*   **Deep Narrative:** Uncover the truth behind the accident and your fractured mind.", "short_description": "Escape a pitch-black facility using only echolocation. Sound reveals puzzles and pathways, but also alerts the terrifying entities lurking in the dark. Speak to see. Stay silent to survive."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://w42dev.netlify.app/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "W42", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://w42dev.netlify.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supporte